summary:
  Any larger view that is larger at all is offered.

history:
  With the limit counted in the screen's pixels, a cover of 300 on a
  cover frame of 310 may be shown 343 wide: a tenth larger, a click for a
  picture that looks the same. A view is offered when it is a quarter
  larger than the cover by its side. This mutant offers any that is larger.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverLogic.js

find:
  var GAIN = 1.25;

replace:
  var GAIN = 1;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_coverlogic.qml::test_a_view_only_a_little_larger_is_not_offered.
  Line-neutral.
